Changes
=======

v2 has many incompatibilities with v0. To see the full list of differences
between v0 and v2, please read the [Changes-v2.md](./Changes-v2.md) file. For a
step-by-step migration guide with code examples, see [MIGRATION.md](./MIGRATION.md).

UNRELEASED
  * Initial v2 release. Brings the tool up-to-date with 2026 standards after 12 year hiatus.
